  "description": "Yoon Jabi has a secret—he harbors erotic fantasies about the person he likes. Living a quiet life running his small bookstore, Between Seasons, everything changes when a reckless troublemaker, Cha Songkyung, barges into his life. Needing a job, Songkyung blackmails Jabi with his secret and ends up working at the bookstore.\n\n*“Boss, let me help you.”*\n\nBut the moment Jabi touches Songkyung, the fantasies that never faded suddenly vanish. Just who is this shameless man?!\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/btw_season), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/btw_season)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/thwt_3459)",
